The CAD files in this repository are modified versions of
"setup/FlattenFold/end-effector-camera-mount-d435i-centered.STEP" from that project.
Modifications: the mount geometry was reworked for the AgileX Piper arm and to fit the
Intel RealSense D435 / D435i / D405 interchangeably, and the model was split into
separate printable parts and exported to STL and 3MF.
